Description: Drop the Python 3.14 classifier for noble
 Noble's python3-trove-classifiers predates "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.14",
 and hatchling refuses to build with a classifier it does not know.
Author: 0xdolan <0xdolan@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-08

--- a/packages/python-cli/pyproject.toml
+++ b/packages/python-cli/pyproject.toml
@@ -21,7 +21,6 @@
   "Programming Language :: Python :: 3 :: Only",
   "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.12",
   "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.13",
-  "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.14",
   "Topic :: Security",
   "Topic :: Text Processing",
   "Typing :: Typed",
